  "2026-06-04T07:17:32.855Z",codex-sdk-continuation,"Live Sentry evidence before fix: gate saw critical=0 high=3 from PM-CLI-1C Slack webhook returned HTTP 404 no_team, PM-CLI-1B preflight structural validation abort, and PM-CLI-19 validation failed with 2 structural errors. These are handled CommandError/PmCliError cases, not unhandled runtime defects. Patched the expected handled CLI classifier narrowly and verified live gate now reports critical=0 high=0, ignored_expected_cli_error_total=12, telemetry finish_error_rate_pct=1.99, failures_without_error_code_rows=0."
  "2026-06-04T07:19:28.785Z",codex-sdk-continuation,"Evidence: refreshed live Sentry gate expected handled CLI classifier. Verification passed: tests/integration/release-automation-contract.spec.ts, live node scripts/release/sentry-telemetry-gate.mjs --json with critical=0 high=0, telemetry stack health with 15110 events in last 24h, and pnpm build."
